oint mode at 7 seconds left in the game.\n- You can move the basket position after placing the basket and in-between games.\n- Improved basket graphics.\n- Added basic sound effects.\n- Switched to Meta's controller models.\n- Will fallback to a default environment and still work if you do not give the app permission to access your scene data.\n- Added tooltips to help explain how to place the basket and shoot the ball.\n- Other minor bug fixes.", "created_date": 1765868678, "id": "25646544218295970", "version": "8.0.0", "version_code": 8, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}